            ["Truncated responses on real accounts", "Unknown (META_MAX_PAGES default 200 pages × 200 rows)", "0 truncated=true on routine reporting accounts", "Inspect truncated flag in tool output"],
            ["Unintended writes", "0 (writes unregistered by default)", "0", "Meta Business Manager change log review"],
            ["Retry-absorbed failures", "Not measured", "Transient failures never surface as tool errors within the retry budget", "stderr inspection during long snapshot runs"],
