            ["FR-6", "Bounded retry with jittered exponential backoff", "Must", "Retries Graph codes 1/2/4/17/32/341/613 and HTTP 429/500/502/503/504 up to META_MAX_RETRIES; backoff 500ms doubling plus up to 250ms jitter; non-retryable Graph errors throw immediately"],
